WEBVTT

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.740
Ugoku na! Saizu saisun

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.140
Hikaru sensu sutairu

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:19.240
Konsaba avu~angyarudo emo

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:22.600
Hayari dake janai

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:28.100
Warui yō ni wa shinai ka na zenbu makasete oke♪

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:34.040
Hora machibari ni kiwotsukete kimi mo mi chigaeru

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.600
Tokubetsu ni watashi ga mitateru zo♪

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.440
Daijōbu enryo wa iranai zo♪

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:47.440
Nuime no hotsure ga ki ni narukara ugokanaide

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:54.620
Munewohatte aruite ku watashi ga kimeta mōdo de

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.000
Kimi no ude o hikinagara saikō no miryoku de

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.200
Hirugaeru kaze sukāto on'nanokonara daredemo

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:12.460
Sōda kimi wa otokonokoda kke？　Sore wa tomokaku

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.160
Chotto chotto ne？　Kore o kite miro♪

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:18.040
GOOD♪　GOOD♪　Iku zo♪

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:31.120
Munewohatte aruite ku watashi ga kimeta mōdo de

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.220
Kimi no ude o hikinagara saikō no miryoku de

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:42.620
Hirugaeru kaze sukāto on'nanokonara daredemo

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:48.880
Sō ka kimi wa otokonokoda kke？　Sore wa tomokaku！

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:51.900
Chotto chotto ne？　Kimi mo kite miro♪

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:54.340
Chotto matte imaichi…？

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:57.700
Chotto chotto ja！　Kore o kite miro♪

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:00.440
GOOD♪ 　GOOD♪　 Iku zo♪
